msgid "Preparing your code..."
msgstr "Je code wordt voorbereid..."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:114
msgid "Scan this code with WhatsApp."
msgstr "Scan deze code met WhatsApp."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:115
msgid "The code expired."
msgstr "De code is verlopen."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:116
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:508
msgid "Get a new code"
msgstr "Nieuwe code opvragen"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:117
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:509
msgid "Upgrade your plan"
msgstr "Upgrade je abonnement"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:118
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:292
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:362
msgid "Something went wrong. Please try again."
msgstr "Er ging iets mis. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:119
msgid "Sending..."
msgstr "Versturen..."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:120
msgid "Test message sent. Check your WhatsApp."
msgstr "Testbericht verstuurd. Kijk in je WhatsApp."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:135
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:162
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:210
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:242
msgid "You do not have permission to do this."
msgstr "Je hebt hiervoor geen toestemming."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:201
msgid "Connected to TextMeFlow."
msgstr "Verbonden met TextMeFlow."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:218
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:414
msgid "Disconnected from TextMeFlow."
msgstr "Verbinding met TextMeFlow verbroken."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:248
msgid "Not connected to TextMeFlow."
msgstr "Niet verbonden met TextMeFlow."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:262
msgid "Could not reach TextMeFlow. Please try again."
msgstr "TextMeFlow is niet bereikbaar. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:273
msgid ""
"The connection with TextMeFlow is no longer valid. Please disconnect and "
"connect again."
msgstr "De verbinding met TextMeFlow is niet meer geldig. Verbreek de verbinding en verbind opnieuw."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:281
msgid "Your plan allows no more linked WhatsApp numbers."
msgstr "Je abonnement laat geen extra gekoppelde WhatsApp-nummers meer toe."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:287
msgid "Your message quota is used up or you are sending too fast."
msgstr "Je berichtenquotum is op of je verstuurt te snel."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:290
msgid "That phone number is not valid."
msgstr "Dat telefoonnummer is niet geldig."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:379
msgid "Enter your own WhatsApp number first, including the country if you can."
msgstr "Vul eerst je eigen WhatsApp-nummer in, bij voorkeur met landcode."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:387
msgid "Test message sent."
msgstr "Testbericht verstuurd."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:413
msgid "Connected to TextMeFlow. Now link your WhatsApp number below."
msgstr "Verbonden met TextMeFlow. Koppel hieronder nu je WhatsApp-nummer."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:415
msgid "The connection was not approved. You can try again whenever you like."
msgstr "De verbinding werd niet goedgekeurd. Je kan het altijd opnieuw proberen."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:416
msgid "Connecting did not work. Please try again."
msgstr "Verbinden is niet gelukt. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:417
msgid "The connection request expired. Please try again."
msgstr "De verbindingsaanvraag is verlopen. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:468
msgid "Send WhatsApp messages from your own number"
msgstr "Verstuur WhatsApp-berichten vanaf je eigen nummer"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:470
msgid "Click the button below and log in or create a free TextMeFlow account."
msgstr "Klik op de knop hieronder en log in of maak een gratis TextMeFlow-account aan."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:471
msgid "Approve the connection. You come back here automatically."
msgstr "Keur de verbinding goed. Je komt automatisch hier terug."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:472
msgid "Scan the code with WhatsApp. Done."
msgstr "Scan de code met WhatsApp. Klaar."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:477
msgid "Connect to TextMeFlow"
msgstr "Verbind met TextMeFlow"

#. translators: 1: link to privacy policy, 2: link to terms
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:483
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Phone numbers and message texts are sent to TextMeFlow (hosted in the EU) "
"only to deliver your messages. See the %1$s and the %2$s."
msgstr "Telefoonnummers en berichtteksten gaan enkel naar TextMeFlow (gehost in de EU) om je berichten te bezorgen. Zie de %1$s en de %2$s."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:484
msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr "privacyverklaring"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:485
msgid "terms"
msgstr "voorwaarden"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:500
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Verbinding"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:504
msgid ""
"Open WhatsApp on your phone, go to Settings, then Linked devices, then Link "
"a device, and scan this code."
msgstr "Open WhatsApp op je telefoon, ga naar Instellingen, dan Gekoppelde apparaten, dan Een apparaat koppelen, en scan deze code."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:505
msgid "QR code to link WhatsApp"
msgstr "QR-code om WhatsApp te koppelen"

#. translators: %s: TextMeFlow account e-mail
#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:517
#, php-format
msgid "TextMeFlow account: %s"
msgstr "TextMeFlow-account: %s"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:521
msgid "Open your TextMeFlow account"
msgstr "Open je TextMeFlow-account"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:527
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Verbinding verbreken"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:541
msgid "Your number"
msgstr "Jouw nummer"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:544
msgid "Your WhatsApp number"
msgstr "Je WhatsApp-nummer"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:547
msgid "Send me a test message"
msgstr "Stuur mij een testbericht"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:549
msgid "Alerts about new orders and form submissions go to this number."
msgstr "Meldingen over nieuwe bestellingen en formulierinzendingen gaan naar dit nummer."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:553
msgid "Country for numbers without country code"
msgstr "Land voor nummers zonder landcode"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:556
msgid "Automatic (shop country or site language)"
msgstr "Automatisch (land van de winkel of sitetaal)"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:574
msgid "WooCommerce orders"
msgstr "WooCommerce-bestellingen"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:577
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is not active on this site. Install and activate it to send "
"order messages."
msgstr "WooCommerce is niet actief op deze site. Installeer en activeer het om bestelberichten te versturen."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:584
msgid "Processing (order received / paid)"
msgstr "In behandeling (bestelling ontvangen / betaald)"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:585
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Voltooid"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:586
msgid "On hold"
msgstr "In de wacht"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:587
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "Geannuleerd"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:588
msgid "Refunded"
msgstr "Terugbetaald"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:589
msgid "Failed payment"
msgstr "Mislukte betaling"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:594
msgid "Customer permission"
msgstr "Toestemming van de klant"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:598
msgid ""
"Ask at checkout with a checkbox (recommended). Messages are only sent to "
"customers who tick it."
msgstr "Vraag het bij het afrekenen met een vinkje (aanbevolen). Berichten gaan enkel naar klanten die het aanvinken."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:602
msgid ""
"I already have my customers' permission to message them on WhatsApp (no "
"checkbox)."
msgstr "Ik heb al de toestemming van mijn klanten om hen via WhatsApp te berichten (geen vinkje)."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:606
msgid "Checkbox text"
msgstr "Tekst bij het vinkje"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:610
msgid "Messages to your customers"
msgstr "Berichten naar je klanten"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:622
msgid "Alert to yourself"
msgstr "Melding aan jezelf"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:626
msgid "Message me for every new order (uses your number above)"
msgstr "Stuur mij een bericht bij elke nieuwe bestelling (gebruikt je nummer hierboven)"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:643
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formulieren"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:648
msgid "Form plugin"
msgstr "Formulierplugin"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:649
msgid "Alert me about new submissions"
msgstr "Waarschuw mij bij nieuwe inzendingen"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:650
msgid "Confirm to the visitor"
msgstr "Bevestiging aan de bezoeker"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:659
msgid "Not active on this site"
msgstr "Niet actief op deze site"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:669
msgid ""
"A confirmation is only sent when the form has a phone field and a checkbox "
"for WhatsApp permission. Give that checkbox a name or label that contains "
"\"whatsapp\" (for example \"whatsapp-consent\"). Without that ticked "
"checkbox, nothing is sent to the visitor."
msgstr "Een bevestiging wordt enkel verstuurd als het formulier een telefoonveld en een vinkje voor WhatsApp-toestemming heeft. Geef dat vinkje een naam of label met \"whatsapp\" (bijvoorbeeld \"whatsapp-consent\"). Zonder aangevinkt vinkje gaat er niets naar de bezoeker."

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:674
msgid "Alert to you"
msgstr "Melding aan jou"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:678
msgid "Confirmation to the visitor"
msgstr "Bevestiging aan de bezoeker"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:691
msgid "You can use these placeholders:"
msgstr "Je kan deze tijdelijke aanduidingen gebruiken:"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:705
msgid "Recent activity"
msgstr "Recente activiteit"

#: includes/class-textmeflow-admin.php:707
msgid "Nothing yet."
msgstr "Nog niets."

